From 84e925e19ae70c5b3c6912b698fbec4489b80b8c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Slashy <amirramy.chatbi@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 17:42:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] feat(p01): a deployment can remove tools it cannot use

Groq answered 413 Request too large: the prompt reached 25k tokens, most of it
schemas for tools this deployment has no account for. config.disabledTools
removes them from the offer and from the prompt, and a 413 now cools a provider
for 30 minutes instead of 10 (a shorter cooldown just burns the daily budget).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NptGK4Xppd57AQrT6DuM24
